1
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:19,640
We lost 300 ryo, thanks 
to your meddling.

2
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:22,440
We won't go back empty-handed.

3
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,900
If your hands are so 
empty, will you hold this?

4
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,310
Is it true they hired you 
for only twenty ryo?

5
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:58,390
Yes.

6
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:03,270
The sword we stole was a treasure 
given to them by the Shogun.

7
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:07,400
And they'll only pay 
twenty to get it back?

8
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,320
Ridiculous!

9
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:12,740
They're a poor, small clan.

10
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:16,410
Trying to swindle 300 ryo for 
a sword is asking too much.

11
00:01:18,330 --> 00:01:20,410
Shut up! Damn you!

12
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:26,210
Looks like a nasty 
storm's brewing...

13
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:28,050
Can't waste my time here!

14
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:35,340
Ninja Scroll

15
00:02:19,050 --> 00:02:22,390
I won't kill you yet. Not 
before I make you suffer.

16
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:24,980
I'll make you pay for 
smashing my dream.

17
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:29,980
Your dream? That you were going to 
be the true Shogun of the Dark?

18
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:32,400
Don't make me laugh.

19
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:37,950
If you became shogun, you'd 
make this a world of devils.

20
00:02:38,620 --> 00:02:43,370
If you enjoy their company so much... 
then go back to hell!

21
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,180
I'll kill you!

22
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,600
No one can kill me.

23
00:03:38,340 --> 00:03:39,890
You fool!

24
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:28,350
Genma! HERE YOU DIE!
